      ],
      "finding": "When VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER is unset, Triton is available and the unsupported-feature filter is empty, V2 is selected. The CUDA Qwen3 MoE DP8/TP1 static-EP setup has no identified filter match. An explicit environment choice overrides this default. The worker logs and instantiates that choice. EPLB is not an unsupported V2 feature.",
      "id": "automatic-runner",
      "measurement_required": "Archive observed runner selection and relevant environment on every arm and all ranks; source audit is not proof of installed execution.",
