      "finding": "EPLB is not an eager-only condition. The V2 runner resolves graph support from attention/backend and compilation configuration, and its EPLB prepare_forward and post-sampling step surround the model forward. EPLB maps and per-step metadata use mutable tensors; async layer commits retain the number of physical experts. The explicit allgather_reducescatter backend is a CUDA-graph-compatible alternative mentioned by this pin. DeepEP high-throughput and MoonEP have separate graph restrictions that do not describe this launch.",
