      "finding": "The background worker computes a map and transfers one layer into an intermediate buffer. Foreground EplbState.step checks all-rank result readiness; _move_to_workspace copies weights to their execution workspace, commits the layer maps and then acknowledges consumption. rebalanced becomes false only after the final model layer is committed. drain_async explicitly consumes pending results without applying transferred weights; HTTP request drain or worker shutdown cannot be labelled a committed rebalance.",
